# Eucalyptus dalrympleana Maiden subsp. dalrympleana (Mountain White Gum)
# Taxon concept, anatomical subsystems (PO:*), pipe-model & biophysical allometry,
# InstanceState64 ontogenetic parameter bounds, ecological relations (RO:*),
# and South-Eastern Australian Biocultural Country provenance (SPC / Local Contexts).
#
# Evidence boundary (per tree-cases.md):
# Taxonomic, morphological, and biophysical traits below represent sourced working
# reference bounds for the subspecies across its SE Australian montane range
# (working focus: Kosciuszko National Park / Snowy Mountains, NSW). Exact site
# and individual occurrence identification remain pending field resolution.

